---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Publications · 3uio" description="3uio 的论文与学术成果页面。当前尚未添加任何论文。">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="page-heading reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">PUBLICATIONS / 论文</p>
        <h1>Research outputs,<br />when they are ready.</h1>
        <p>这里为未来经过验证、可公开的论文与研究成果预留位置。当前没有添加任何论文记录。</p>
      </header>

      <section class="empty-state" aria-labelledby="empty-title">
        <div class="empty-mark" aria-hidden="true">∅</div>
        <div>
          <span class="status">NO ENTRIES YET</span>
          <h2 id="empty-title">暂无 Publications</h2>
          <p>没有使用占位论文或虚构作者、会议、期刊信息。真实内容将按统一字段发布。</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <p class="publication-note">公开项目中的 manuscript 描述不会在这里被自动视为正式 publication。待 Title、Authors、Venue、Year 与 Paper 链接均可公开核验后，再添加条目。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .empty-state { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr; align-items: center; min-height: 330px; padding: 45px; border: 1px dashed #afc2d2; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: rgba(255,255,255,.56); }
  .empty-mark { display: grid; width: 110px; height: 110px; place-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 50%; color: var(--accent); font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 3rem; }
  .empty-state h2 { margin: 18px 0 12px; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
  .empty-state p { max-width: 600px; margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .publication-note { max-width: 780px; margin: 28px auto 0; color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: .82rem; text-align: center; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .empty-state { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; padding: 30px 24px; }
  }
</style>
